// M5-A3P-1003. Ch18 K05 "The farewell-tide, taught" (E, held input, 4 min). act3_ch18.md §2 K05;
// act3_threads T-04; ending_cost_audit §1. Dusk, the shore. Pell teaches Asha the tune WORDLESS, the way Kirru children
// learn it: hum, then turn your back, then hum again; held inputs on the turn (the player turns Asha's back). The clutch
// hums under them. Ysolde writes the shape (rises and falls, no notes): "That's the Letting." said ONCE.
// README rule 3: ASHA NEVER SINGS WORDS HERE; the Eighth Verse is never sung before H07.
// THE TRADE: when Pell is done, Asha hums the Velamir lullaby back to him, unasked. The only time in the game she hums
// something because she wants to; nobody says it's the last. Rhen hears it from the shore's edge.
title: ch18_farewell_tide_taught
location: ch10/reedhollow
---
@camera K09
@music farewell_tide fade=3.0
@mark pell shore_teach walk
@mark asha shore_teach_b walk
@mark rhen shore_edge walk
@wait 3.0
Pell [neutral]: Hum it with me. Then turn your back. Then hum it again. That is all children are told. #line:ch18_tide_001
@anim pell hum
@anim asha hum
@wait 6.0
<<event hold_input turn_back>>
@anim asha turn_back sea
@anim pell turn_back sea
@wait 3.0
<<event hold_input_end>>
@sfx clutch_hum vol=0.5
@anim asha hum
@wait 8.0
@camera K10
@anim ysolde write farewell_shape
@wait 3.0
Ysolde [neutral]: That's the Letting. #line:ch18_tide_002
@wait 3.0
@camera K09
Pell [tender]: You have it. Your back was the right way. #line:ch18_tide_003
@wait 3.0
@music silence fade=2.0
@anim asha turn_to pell
@sfx velamir_lullaby_hum at=asha vol=0.6
@wait 10.0
@camera K11
@anim rhen look_at asha
@wait 3.0
Pell [soft_smile]: A trade, then. I will keep it. #line:ch18_tide_004
@wait 3.0
<<set $ch18_learned_farewell_tide = true>>
===
